  "title": "J & J SNACK FOODS SCHEDULES FISCAL 2025 FOURTH QUARTER EARNINGS CONFERENCE CALL AND WEBCAST",
  "summary": "MOUNT LAUREL, N.J. , Oct. 29, 2025 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- J & J Snack Foods Corp. (Nasdaq: JJSF) today announced that it will release financial results for its fourth quarter and full fiscal year ended September 27, 2025 , before the stock market opens on Monday, November 17, 2025 .",
